  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-formula-card\"><header><h3>geographically-weighted-regression</h3><span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--derived\" data-provenance=\"derived\">curated formula</span></header><div><pre class=\"lens-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{weight}{w_{ij}}&amp;=\\left(1-\\frac{d_{ij}^2}{\\term{bandwidth}{h_i}^2}\\right)^2\\ (d_{ij}&lt;h_i),\\ \\text{else }0\\\\\n\\term{coefficients}{\\beta_i}&amp;=(Z_i^\\top W_i Z_i)^{-1}Z_i^\\top W_i\\,y,\n&amp;\\term{hat}{S_{ii}}&amp;=\\left[(Z_i^\\top W_i Z_i)^{-1}\\right]_{00}\\\\\n\\term{aicc}{\\mathrm{AICc}}&amp;=n\\ln\\frac{\\term{residualSum}{\\mathrm{RSS}}}{n}+n\\ln 2\\pi+\\frac{n\\,(n+\\term{traceSum}{\\operatorname{tr}S})}{n-2-\\operatorname{tr}S},\n&amp;\\term{standardErrors}{\\mathrm{se}_{ik}}&amp;=\\sqrt{\\hat\\sigma^2\\,[C_iC_i^\\top]_{kk}}\\\\\n\\term{tValues}{t_{ik}}&amp;=\\frac{\\beta_{ik}}{\\mathrm{se}_{ik}}\n\\end{aligned}</pre><p class=\"lens-ascii\">w_ij = (1 - (d_ij/h_i)^2)^2 for d_ij &lt; h_i, else 0 (bisquare); h_i = 1.00001 x distance to the k-th nearest included tract (adaptive). beta_i = (Z_i&#39; W_i Z_i)^-1 Z_i&#39; W_i y with z_j = (1, x_j - x_i), so the intercept is the fit at tract i and S_ii = [(Z&#39;WZ)^-1]_00. AICc = n ln(RSS/n) + n ln 2pi + n (n + tr S)/(n - 2 - tr S) is minimised over k by golden-section search. se_ik = sqrt(sigma2 [C C&#39;]_kk) with C = (Z&#39;WZ)^-1 Z&#39;W and sigma2 = RSS/(n - tr S); t_ik = beta_ik/se_ik. Singular tracts give NaN.</p></div><div class=\"lens-symbols\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-search-bounds-rows\" data-value=\"weight\">weight · intermediate · weight</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-search-bounds-rows\" data-value=\"bandwidth\">bandwidth · parameter · bandwidth</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-search-bounds-rows\" data-value=\"coefficients\">local coefficients · output · beta</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-search-bounds-rows\" data-value=\"hat\">hat · intermediate · hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-select\" data-value=\"aicc\">aicc · intermediate · candidateScore</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-search-bounds-rows\" data-value=\"residualSum\">residualSum · intermediate · residualSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-tile-candidates\" data-value=\"traceSum\">effective parameters · intermediate · traceSum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-fit\" data-value=\"standardErrors\">standardErrors · output · standardError</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"lens-symbol-chip lens-symbol-chip--bound\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"node\" data-key=\"gpu-spatial-analysis.geographically-weighted-regression-compiled:geographically-weighted-regression-fit\" data-value=\"tValues\">tValues · output · tValue</button></div><div class=\"lens-kernels\"></div><p>apple</p></section>",
