  "formula": {
    "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\n\\term{weight}{w_{ij}}&=\\left(1-\\frac{d_{ij}^2}{\\term{bandwidth}{h_i}^2}\\right)^2\\ (d_{ij}<h_i),\\ \\text{else }0\\\\\n\\term{coefficients}{\\beta_i}&=(Z_i^\\top W_i Z_i)^{-1}Z_i^\\top W_i\\,y,\n&\\term{hat}{S_{ii}}&=\\left[(Z_i^\\top W_i Z_i)^{-1}\\right]_{00}\\\\\n\\term{aicc}{\\mathrm{AICc}}&=n\\ln\\frac{\\term{residualSum}{\\mathrm{RSS}}}{n}+n\\ln 2\\pi+\\frac{n\\,(n+\\term{traceSum}{\\operatorname{tr}S})}{n-2-\\operatorname{tr}S},\n&\\term{standardErrors}{\\mathrm{se}_{ik}}&=\\sqrt{\\hat\\sigma^2\\,[C_iC_i^\\top]_{kk}}\\\\\n\\term{tValues}{t_{ik}}&=\\frac{\\beta_{ik}}{\\mathrm{se}_{ik}}\n\\end{aligned}",
    "ascii": "w_ij = (1 - (d_ij/h_i)^2)^2 for d_ij < h_i, else 0 (bisquare); h_i = 1.00001 x distance to the k-th nearest included tract (adaptive). beta_i = (Z_i' W_i Z_i)^-1 Z_i' W_i y with z_j = (1, x_j - x_i), so the intercept is the fit at tract i and S_ii = [(Z'WZ)^-1]_00. AICc = n ln(RSS/n) + n ln 2pi + n (n + tr S)/(n - 2 - tr S) is minimised over k by golden-section search. se_ik = sqrt(sigma2 [C C']_kk) with C = (Z'WZ)^-1 Z'W and sigma2 = RSS/(n - tr S); t_ik = beta_ik/se_ik. Singular tracts give NaN.",
